The legal text in this repository

Based on content from the South Australian Legislation website at 29 October 2026. For the latest information on South Australian Government legislation, please go to www.legislation.sa.gov.au/ .

Despite any headers, footers or other markings, this legislation is NOT published under the Legislation Revision and Publication Act 2002. To access legislation that is published under the Legislation Revision and Publication Act 2002, please go to www.legislation.sa.gov.au/ .

Copyright in the content of www.legislation.sa.gov.au is owned by the State of South Australia, which licenses it under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
(Copyright Notice, https://www.legislation.sa.gov.au/copyright, paragraphs 3, 4, 7 and 9). The State's emblems
(Piping Shrike, Royal Arms) are not reproduced. Changes made: each consolidated version (RTF) of each Act has been split
into one file per provision, with white space, soft hyphens and footnote markers normalised, and the history between
versions reconstructed into commits from the versions' legislative history tables. Neither the State of South
Australia nor the Commissioner for Legislation Revision and Publication endorses this repository.

The Acts added from the open data

Office of Parliamentary Counsel, Government of South Australia, Legislative Database Update Package (XML) and Legislative Database, sourced on 2026-11-02, https://data.sa.gov.au/data/dataset/database-update-package-xml and https://data.sa.gov.au/data/dataset/legislative-database. The datasets are licensed by the Government of South Australia under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 Licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/; https://data.sa.gov.au/copyright).
Changes made: each version split into one file per provision, white space normalised, and the history between versions
reconstructed into commits from the versions' legislative history tables. The South Australian Government does not
endorse this repository.

